flowchart LR
  Browser[Browser / React SPA] --> Proxy[Vercel or local same-origin proxy]
  Proxy --> Security[Spring Security / JWT / OIDC]
  Security --> API[Spring Boot REST controllers]
  API --> Services[Domain services]
  Services --> DB[(MySQL 8 / Flyway)]
  Services --> Cache[(Redis cache)]
  Services --> Outbox[Transactional outbox]
  Outbox --> Broker[(RabbitMQ)]
  Services --> AI[Spring AI ChatClient]
  AI --> LLM[Configured LLM provider]
  Services --> Pay[Razorpay gateway]
  Security --> Google[Google OpenID Connect]
